<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p>
    The products most directly influenced by our <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/blogs/news/fw19-inspiration" target="_blank">FW19 inspiration</a> of the harvest season are the Work Jacket and Utility Pant. We took them out of their usual environment of fields and work sheds, and brought them to downtown NYC. 
  </p>
</div>

<div class="left-50" style="opacity: 1;">
  <div class="img-left-wrapper max-width-800">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/adsum-9B3A0477.jpg?10714" class="img-left ss16-preview">
  </div>
</div>

<div class="right-50 float-right" style="opacity: 1;">
